Z||000001||skitime||08-21-2001||06:05 PM||||You can get round clips from places like Autozone and trim the heads to fit in the slots like the originals and press them into the pillar. Works great. Just dont get too large ones.<P>------------------<BR><UL TYPE=SQUARE><BR><LI>Red 88 GT T-TOP<BR><LI>Red 86 GT<BR></UL> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/signature-1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
